  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 1002.02 Scope. This part shall apply to all funds disbursed through the trust fund and all applicants and governmental entities receiving funding through the trust fund.\n\nSource. #13396, eff 6-21-22; ss by #14054, eff 8-17-24",
